<li>Asy-Syaikh Al-’Allamah Muhammad Yasin bin ‘Isa Al Fadani Al-Makki (direktur Madrasah Ad-Diniyah Darul ‘Ulum Makkah Al-Mukarramah),</<li>
<li>Asy-Syaikh Muhammad Nursayf Rahimahullah,</<li>
<li>Al-Habib Al-’Alim Al-Allamah Abdul Qadir bin Ahmad As-Seggaf (wali quthb, Jeddah),</<li>
